# Rank 2 Mission 2 (battlefield.rank_2_mission_2): Waughroon Shrine's three arenas filled by registrants. Four level
# 75 Warriors of San d'Oria, each alone, each with Journey to Bastok (the second) current at Status 10 and the Dark
# Key (GMs). main's menu, area 1 (option 1): registered, entered. bob's menu, area 1 asked: registerBattlefield finds
# no registration of bob, so LoadBattlefield: one of 3 battlefields loaded, area 1 taken: INCREMENT_REQUEST, which
# onEntryEventUpdate answers as WAIT (0x05C [1]); the client then asks the next arena: area 2 (option 2): registered,
# entered. cid's menu, area 3 (option 3): registered, entered. dan meets entryRequirement as a registrant too, but
# getBattlefieldOptions' battlefieldAtCapacity holds (3 of 3 loaded): no option: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY. No timing or
# RNG dependency (no tick: the three fights stay open).
lists WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrigger WaughroonShrine/onEventUpdate/32000 WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32000
char zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char cid zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char dan zone=WaughroonShrine pos=-338.1,104.3,-260.3 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Sandoria JourneyToBastok2 current
keyitem DarkKey
bob: mission Sandoria JourneyToBastok2 current
bob: keyitem DarkKey
cid: mission Sandoria JourneyToBastok2 current
cid: keyitem DarkKey
dan: mission Sandoria JourneyToBastok2 current
dan: keyitem DarkKey
login
missionstatus Sandoria 10               # a GM
bob: login
bob: missionstatus Sandoria 10          # a GM
cid: login
cid: missionstatus Sandoria 10          # a GM
dan: login
dan: missionstatus Sandoria 10          # a GM
trigger BC_Entrance                     # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in arena 1
bob: trigger BC_Entrance                # the menu 32000 (1 of 3 loaded)
bob: update 32000 option=1              # area 1 taken: INCREMENT_REQUEST: WAIT
bob: update 32000 option=2              # area 2: registered, entered
bob: finish                             # in arena 2
cid: trigger BC_Entrance                # the menu 32000 (2 of 3 loaded)
cid: update 32000 option=3              # area 3: registered, entered
cid: finish                             # in arena 3
dan: trigger BC_Entrance                # 3 of 3 loaded: at capacity: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY
